tor","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. September to October came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 172% of normal in May to June and 58% in August to September. Grid 26019 had its driest year in 1980 at 70%.</p>"}
